<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>When</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>when &lt;player name&gt;
</pre>
<p>Shows when a player last logged on, for example:
</p>
<pre>when gandalf
Gandalf last logged on 3 days, 4 hours ago (Sat 10 Oct 2026 01:43).
</pre>
<p>If the player is in the game right now, you are told so instead. After asking about a player who is not in the game, you may have to wait a few seconds before asking about another one. Times are the server's time.
</p><p><br />
See also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Who</a>
</pre>




</div>